Top-level scene identifiers are now uniquely prefixed with `FEATURED_` and the blur filter is capped at 0.9 px.

Every classic scene script runs in the shared global lexical scope, so renaming top-level identifiers prevents parse-time collisions when branches merge. The total blur is now strictly capped during actor entrance so readability across the room is preserved.

